    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BASILISK!</strong> is a movement shooter where <strong>STYLE! IS! SUBSTANCE!</strong> With a constantly draining Style Meter as your health, stay alive by moving, slashing, and parkouring your way to the center of Complex One to unplug mankind\u2019s new AI overlord, the BASILISK, once and for all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Style is Substance</strong>    <br>The only way to gain health is by doing stylish actions! The more of a combo you rack up, and the more varied your playstyle, the more style/health you get!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921630/extras/b3214855cc9065a04971edf5b651f896.poster.avif?t=1748723400\" width=616 height=411 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921630/extras/b3214855cc9065a04971edf5b651f896.webm?t=1748723400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Climb the Complex</strong>    <br>In BASILISK, almost every surface is climbable. Dash, wallrun, and mantle at ludicrous speeds, out-maneuver your enemies, and soar through levels faster than the eye can see!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921630/extras/042808f31e7a19240e456ac9888fbac2.poster.avif?t=1748723400\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921630/extras/042808f31e7a19240e456ac9888fbac2.webm?t=1748723400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921630/extras/042808f31e7a19240e456ac9888fbac2.mp4?t=1748723400\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>    <br>   </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master The Mission</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Impressive performance in a level will shower you with Credits from your<i> Mysterious Benefactors,</i> which can be used to purchase and upgrade weapons and augments, allowing you to explore previously inaccessible areas and do even better on a subsequent run!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921630/extras/7573215322d06c7e513887114857e44f.poster.avif?t=1748723400\" width=616 height=411 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921630/extras/7573215322d06c7e513887114857e44f.webm?t=1748723400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mod Your Bod</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transcend the flesh and augment yourself into the ultimate killing machine with upgrades found in missions and levelled up with Credits. Many augments gain additional benefits depending on their neighbors, so mix and match until you find the perfect synergy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921630/extras/9676c1239b633983e29d1974c07d69ab.poster.avif?t=1748723400\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921630/extras/9676c1239b633983e29d1974c07d69ab.webm?t=1748723400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921630/extras/9676c1239b633983e29d1974c07d69ab.mp4?t=1748723400\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BASILISK!</strong> is a movement shooter where <strong>STYLE! IS! SUBSTANCE!</strong> With a constantly draining Style Meter as your health, stay alive by moving, slashing, and parkouring your way to the center of Complex One to unplug mankind\u2019s new AI overlord, the BASILISK, once and for all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Style is Substance</strong>    <br>The only way to gain health is by doing stylish actions! The more of a combo you rack up, and the more varied your playstyle, the more style/health you get!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921630/extras/b3214855cc9065a04971edf5b651f896.poster.avif?t=1748723400\" width=616 height=411 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921630/extras/b3214855cc9065a04971edf5b651f896.webm?t=1748723400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Climb the Complex</strong>    <br>In BASILISK, almost every surface is climbable. Dash, wallrun, and mantle at ludicrous speeds, out-maneuver your enemies, and soar through levels faster than the eye can see!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921630/extras/042808f31e7a19240e456ac9888fbac2.poster.avif?t=1748723400\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921630/extras/042808f31e7a19240e456ac9888fbac2.webm?t=1748723400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921630/extras/042808f31e7a19240e456ac9888fb